{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Duel opponents and their charmed creatures leave the loser alive (#306)",
  "contract": [
    "A duel ends at one health when the opponent or a creature they control delivers the finishing blow.",
    "At the reported Guardian level of 21, a normal melee attack is the control. A Felsworn starts a second duel,",
    "then uses its level-20 Enslave Elemental spell 954534 on a Dust Devil and commands its normal melee attack",
    "through CMSG_PET_ACTION. The creature has a charmer but no player owner and must still end the duel without",
    "killing the Guardian. After each win the loser remains alive at one health and leaves combat.",
    "A third duel ends in a real death when the Guardian takes lethal self damage; duel protection must not",
    "prevent damage unrelated to the opponent. Duel requests, acceptance, attacks and completion use native",
    "session handlers. This checks a controlled-creature reproduction of the report, not its unspecified spell."
  ],
